  "description": "<p><a href=\"http://docs.fcrepo.org/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://docs.fcrepo.org/</a></p>\n\n<p>As of the following commit, the \"mvn site-deploy\" generation of a custom doxia index.html page has been broken:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blame/master/pom.xml#L685\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blame/master/pom.xml#L685</a></p>\n\n<p>This task is to update the doxia/site maven versions/configuration to ensure that a correct index.html page is created based on this template:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/src/site/markdown/index.md.vm\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/src/site/markdown/index.md.vm</a></p>",
